I pick out a few clothes.
Then I go to the fitting room.
I have a pile of clothes in my hand.
First, I pick up a blue kurta.
This is excellent cotton material.
I try on this blue kurta.
This is a large kurta.
It is not small.
This size is right for me.
I look in the mirror.
This blue kurta is beautiful.
Then I check the price tag.
Its price is five hundred rupees.
This price is affordable.
So I decide to buy this blue kurta.
